{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/264663-nwod-fft-homebrew","id":264663,"title":"NWOD FFT Homebrew","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-24T09:53:44-07:00","id":264663,"title":"NWOD FFT Homebrew","content":"Hello, I am new here. I joined hoping I could find some help with something I am trying to work up for myself and friends and anyone else interested.<br /> <br /> So I have searched for a solid system to work a Final Fantasy Tactics game, which my group of players and friends are very interested in. I have looked over Saga and other D20 systems, Warhammer, Cortex and so on and so on. Nothing really catches my eye, until my friend told me just adapt New World of Darkness to the theme. I thought about it and with the lack of levels and amazing character customization would really work with the multiple class system in FFT. I don't need it to be just like FFT, but something close to it.<br /> <br /> I have read over some of God Machine and some of the other books and I think it can be done. Basically I would like to make class categories that have different merits, each category having prerequisites that must be met. Be it certain skills, attributes or a certain amount of dots purchased in another category. <br /> <br /> I know this is a storyteller system and FFT is basically a tactical combat game. But I think it really can be done if gone about well. <br /> <br /> I am just wondering if anyone has any ideas that could be helpful to me.<br /> <br /> I am basically going about magic as a merit system, something simple and basic. But trying to keep it somewhat tame. <br /> <br /> There is a lot of work in front of me, I know this. I was hoping to get some ideas, or tips, something to helping get on the right track to tackle this project. I will post up more of what I have at a later date. For now.. I need sleep.<br /> <br /> Thank you for reading, take care and safe travels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3936-streiter-wulf","name":"Streiter Wulf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T14:25:18-07:00","id":264874,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Moved to New World of Darkness Subforum.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?